    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>I'm Alejandro Companioni, an ML engineer in Miami. I've spent over 15 years building models that actually have to work — recommenders, targeting systems, LLM agents — in a variety of messy domains where being wrong costs someone real money. Currently driving ML product development at an AI infrastructure startup. Previous stops include: Spotify, Stitch Fix, Devoted Health, iHeartRadio, and the Federal Reserve. At parties, people tell me this list sounds really cool before they slink away.</p>
    <p>I only write about career things on this site. Outside of those career things I play lots of tennis, cook and mix drinks, and help my wife chase our two sons around the backyard. All of this happens in Miami, Florida, unless we're not there.</p>
